flowchart TD
  A[Sensor or simulator] -->|Topic + timestamp/value payload| B[Mosquitto broker]
  B -->|Subscribed message| C[Python MQTT consumer]
  C --> D[Parse topic: device and channel type]
  D --> E[Resolve channel ID from metadata]
  E --> F[Parse timestamp and value]
  F --> G{Value numeric?}
  G -->|Yes| H[Numeric measurement table]
  G -->|No| I[Non-numeric measurement table]
  H --> J[(PostgreSQL)]
  I --> J
  J --> K[FastAPI live / analytics endpoints]
  K --> L[React dashboard and charts]
